sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(<br>filter=address, data=C4:AB:12:34:56:78)
    Product->>CN: GapCentral.StartDeviceDiscovery()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(scanning)

    Note over Product, CN: No matching devices found.<br>DeviceDiscovered is never received.

    Note over Product: Product-side timeout expires (e.g. 10 s).<br>Stop scanning and handle the failure.

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.Standby()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)

    Note over Product: Discovery timeout is managed by the Product.<br>The CN will scan indefinitely until Standby() is called.
